abstract: "AsiBackbone 7.5.0 is a backward-compatible minor release of the Accountable Systems Infrastructure package family for .NET. It preserves request trace identifiers across policy and capability evaluation so governed endpoint decisions, receipts, logs, and spans remain joinable. Package IDs, the net10.0 target, canonical wire values, and AssemblyVersion 7.0.0.0 remain unchanged."
